   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Nauru Infrastructure and Services</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Nauru Infrastructure and Services Partnership will support Government of Nauru strategies to reform its utilities sector and essential infrastructure and services. It has an emphasis on: improving the reliability and cost effectiveness of power and water services through more effective governance, maintenance and cost recovery arrangements; increasing use of renewable forms of energy and clean water capture; and supporting maintenance and provision of essential infrastructure and services.</narrative>
  </description>
